">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Building\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Building</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Jerry Junkman</b> was the former shopkeeper of the <a href=\"/wiki/Jer%27s_Junkyard\" title=\"Jer&#39;s Junkyard\">Jer's Junkyard</a> Store. \n</p><p>After the map update, he now resides outside <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Before the map update there was a wanted poster for Jerry offering a <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Refined_Axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Refined Axe\">Tall Refined Axe</a> posted on the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">Oak Depot</a>. It has been removed since the update. \n</p><p>If you dropped a neon cheese on top of him he would turn angelic and spawn a <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Refined_Axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Refined Axe\">Tall Refined Axe</a>. This is no longer working after the map update. \n<